\newlabel{fig:shape_reg_combined_llama}{{4}{9}{\textbf {PRISM-guided shape regularization on Llama-3.1-8B.} LoRA fine-tuning with the auxiliary penalty $\lambda (1-\Omega (Z_0^{\mathrm {ref}}, Z_t^{\mathrm {ref}}))$ (Eq.~\ref {eq:shape_reg}) on TruthfulQA (top row) and BBQ (bottom row). At step $300$: downstream forgetting $|\Delta \mathcal {R}|$ across the downstream benchmarks under $\lambda \in \{0.0, 0.1, 0.5\}$, decreasing as $\lambda $ rises across benchmarks (Table~\ref {tab:trace_norm_llama_truthfulqa}). Qwen3-8B replication: Appendix~\ref {app:qwen_forgetting}}{figure.4}{}}
